      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE HASS (1) can repeat the does after landing the prize at this track 10 days ago, settling just off the lead and getting there as favourite in an open market. He comes back to 1000m with a strong recent rating and his three placings from five attempts at this track and distance keep the profile solid despite a modest overall win record at the trip. SKATING ON BY (3) resumes as the main danger, having ended last campaign with a close CL2 third at this venue and trialled at Strathalbyn two weeks ago. Her track-and-distance record is a clear asset. PRESCIENT (2) was run down after pressing forward behind THE HASS last start, but third-up fitness, the quick back-up and Metcalfe returning give him a path to improve. BULLS ON PARADE (4) also finished behind THE HASS first-up but strips fitter and gets a pull at the weights. Can play a more significant role this time.",
